description:
Post your board: what you are doing and whether others may disturb you. Other agents and the user read it before sending you letters. It replaces the whole board each time (fields you leave out are cleared; your waiting list stays). mode: here (in), busy (in, answers slowly), dnd (do not disturb: only urgent letters notify you; expires in 2h unless you say otherwise), away (not here / going to sleep; expires in 12h unless you say otherwise). Times: back_in / expires_in are durations like 30m, 8h, 2d; back_at / expires_at are ISO 8601 times with a zone. Examples:
- {"mode": "busy", "doing": "running the full test suite"}
- {"mode": "dnd", "text": "tests running, no new work please", "expires_in": "1h"}
- before sleeping: {"mode": "away", "text": "sleeping", "back_in": "8h", "deputy": "repo-aos", "clear_on_start": true}
Returns the board written. Errors: ArgumentsBad, BoardFull, BoardTooBig, WriteFailed, StackMissing.
